  "titleText": {
    "es": "En su momento, programar a los robots sexuales para que disfrutaran del sexo pareció una medida sensata, pero no nos dimos cuenta de las consecuencias del desarrollo de sus fetiches.",
    "en": "Programming the sexbots to enjoy sex seemed a sensible move at the time, but we didn't realize the consequences of their developing fetishes.",
    "noteEn": "The English text is the official xkcd title text; the Spanish archive expands sexbots to robots sexuales. The Spanish raster omits the official GRAB sound, changes official NOM to Spanish ÑAM, and leaves PLINK and KZZZT untranslated. Vision misread those visible sounds as PENt, NAM, and KZZZ2T, and it missed the written accent in QUÍTATE; this artifact follows the raster, teaches ÑAM, and excludes only the two untranslated sounds."
  },
